---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" path="/privacy-policy/">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 20 September 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Nothing.</strong> This is a static website. Text you type into the Hinglish to Hindi converter is converted in your own browser via JavaScript; it is never uploaded, stored or processed on a server. No account is required, and we do not sell, rent or share any personal data because we do not collect any.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Local storage</h2>
    <p>We store only your chosen dark/light theme preference in your browser's localStorage. This stays on your device and is never transmitted to us.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Advertising – Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>This website uses Google AdSense, an advertising service operated by Google LLC, to display advertisements. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies and similar technologies to serve and measure ads, and to show you advertising based on your prior visits to this website and other websites across the internet (interest-based advertising).</p>
    <p>Google may use advertising cookies, such as the DoubleClick cookie, and related technologies such as DART, to help it and its partners serve ads that are relevant to you.</p>
    <p><strong>What we never do:</strong> your typed Hinglish text is never sent to Google, and we do not share personal information with Google for advertising purposes. The site sets no first-party cookies; the only local storage we use is your theme preference described above.</p>
    <p><strong>Opting out of personalized advertising:</strong> you can opt out of Google's personalized ads at any time by visiting <a class="underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also learn more about interest-based advertising and opt out through <a class="underline" href="https://www.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">About Ads</a> and the <a class="underline" href="https://youradchoices.com/control" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Digital Advertising Alliance</a>.</p>
    <p>For details on how Google uses data, please review <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Privacy &amp; Terms</a> and the <a class="underline" href="https://support.google.com/adsense/answer/1348695" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Help Center</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not set its own cookies. Third-party vendors, including Google, may set cookies while serving ads on this site as described above. If you disable cookies in your browser, the converter will continue to work; ads may simply be less relevant to you.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a class="underline" href="mailto:contact@openpixal.com">contact@openpixal.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>